    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95456" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμᾰρᾰγ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crash</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτ᾽ ἀπ᾽
				οὐρανόθεν σμαραγήσῃ</span>, of Zeus (= thunder), <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.199
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμαραγεῖ πόντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.210
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. λειμών</span>
			<i>resounds with the screaming</i> of cranes, ib.<i><span class="en">
				463
			</span></i>; of the battle of the Titans, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				679
			</span></i>; of the bowels, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.154
			</span></i>; of Ares, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψόθε δ᾽ ἐσμαράγησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Del.</u>
					136
				</span></i>
			. (Onomatop., cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφαραγέω</span>.)</div>
